Persistent task-result caching no longer misses after IDE edits or document reopen solely because project defaults repeated the same solver-path assignment. Differing path settings and all other ordered solver options remain distinct. Regression coverage now includes manual selection, save-triggered verification, explicit cancellation and document close/reopen against fresh per-VC verdict and resource-count oracles.
Persistent translation audit also bypasses task-response replay and publication, so its equality comparison uses fresh solver responses and preserves the stored evidence.
